<section class="page-heading wrap"><p class="eyebrow">START A CONVERSATION</p><h1>Good projects start<br>with clear questions.</h1><p class="lede">Tell us where you are, where you want to go, and what stands in the way.</p></section><section class="wrap section contact-grid"><aside><h2>A focused first discussion.</h2><p>Share your project stage and the support you are looking for. Please keep confidential drawings and commercial documents out of this initial enquiry.</p><?php if($settings['email']): ?><a href="mailto:<?= e($settings['email']) ?>"><?= e($settings['email']) ?></a><?php endif ?><?php if($settings['phone']): ?><a href="tel:<?= e(preg_replace('/[^+0-9]/','',$settings['phone'])) ?>"><?= e($settings['phone']) ?></a><?php endif ?><?php if($settings['whatsapp']): ?><a href="https://wa.me/<?= e(preg_replace('/\D/','',$settings['whatsapp'])) ?>">Chat on WhatsApp ↗</a><?php endif ?></aside><form id="contact-form" class="panel"><div class="form-grid"><label>Your name<input name="name" required maxlength="160" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email"></label><label>Phone number <small>(optional)</small><input name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="40" autocomplete="tel"></label><label>How can we help?<select name="service" required><?php foreach($services as $service): ?><option><?= e($service['title']) ?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><label class="full">Your project<textarea name="message" rows="6" required maxlength="5000"></textarea></label><label class="trap" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label><label class="check full"><input name="consent" type="checkbox" required> I consent to my details being stored and used to respond to this enquiry.</label></div><button class="button" type="submit">Send your enquiry ↗</button><p class="form-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section>
